flowchart LR
    A[Operator submits transcript] --> B[Classify issue and severity]
    B --> C[Extract or update customer]
    C --> D[Create support case]
    D --> E[Open workflow run]
    E --> F{Gemini ADK available?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Run root agent]
    G --> H[Task, notes, calendar specialists]
    H --> I[MCP tool calls]
    F -->|No| J[Deterministic fallback]
    G --> K{ADK succeeded?}
    K -->|No| J
    K -->|Yes| I
    J --> I
    I --> L[Persist tasks, notes, events]
    L --> M[Store run steps and artifacts]
    M --> N[Return engine mode and summaries]
    N --> O[Support Queue, Cases, Tasks, Calendar, Traces]
